eshS288","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GaneshS288/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2025-01-12T12:00:24Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2590387357","html_url":"https://github.com/facebook/react/issues/31977#issuecomment-2590387357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/31977","id":2590387357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAJy2Ks6aZiyd","user":{"login":"V3RON","id":8137511,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzc1MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8137511?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON","html_url":"https://github.com/V3RON","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T16:11:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T16:13:32Z","body":"I believe I have pinpointed the exact reason why this is happening.\n\nProfiling works fine the first time, but subsequently, the Dev Tools enter an infinite loop of state updates. It begins with a call to the `startProfiling` function. Next, SnapshotSelector invokes `selectCommitIndex(0)` because profiling data from a previous session is available, which triggers another re-render. Then, ProfilerContextProvider calls `selectCommitIndex(null)` because no commit is selected, causing yet another re-render. This loop continues indefinitely.\n\nHowever, when you pause execution using a debugger in the `startProfiling` function and first call `clear` to remove the existing profiling data, everything functions correctly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/facebook/react/issues/comments/2590387357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"V3RON","id":8137511,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzc1MTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8137511?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON","html_url":"https://github.com/V3RON","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V3RON/received_events","type":"User","user_vi